# v1.21.1 Replace in all notes, link matches: trip.md has only [[link]]
# matches, so it starts "0 of 2" and the button is greyed; the sheet says why
# in a status line under the header, the "link" tag sits next to the line
# number, and a tap on the note row ticks the links (Forma 1440x1920).
open-fixture tests/emu/fixtures/trip.md
open-fixture tests/emu/fixtures/harbour-walk.md
tap-on Files
tap-on New note
clear-field
type scratch
tap-on OK
type Nothing to replace here.
tap-on Find
tap-on All notes
expect-mode find
type harbour
tap-on ReplaceField
type port
tap-on All
shot v1.21.1-replace-links-sheet
# Untick the other note: nothing is ticked, the button is greyed and the
# status line says why.
tap-on ReviewNote:harbour-walk.md
shot v1.21.1-replace-links-greyed
# Tap the note row: the links of trip.md are ticked and the button lights up.
tap-on ReviewNote:trip.md
shot v1.21.1-replace-links-ticked
tap-on ReviewApply
expect-file-contains trip.md|[[port]]
shot v1.21.1-replace-links-applied
tap-on ReplaceUndo
expect-file-contains trip.md|[[harbour]]
tap-on FindClose
